hadiths[18]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1113","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab momin aag se najaat paaengey to Jannat aur aag key darmiyaan pul par rok liye jaaengey. To duniya mein jo zulm unkey darmiyaan they unka badla lengey. Yahan tak ke jab wo paak aur saaf ho jaaengey to unhey Jannat mein daakhil honay ki ijazat di jaaeygi. To qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Un mein se koi Jannat mein apne maskan ko apne duniya key thikaaney se zyada jaanta hoga. (Bukhari: 2440)"
"1114","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak Allah momin ko qareeb karega aur us par apna parda rakkheyga aur use dhaanpega. To farmaaeyga: Kya tum fulaan gunaah jaantey ho? Kya tum fulaan gunaah jaantey ho? To wo kahega: Haan, ae merey Rab! Yahan tak ke jab wo usey uskey gunaahon ka iqraar karaaeyga aur wo apne aap mein dekhega ke wo halaak ho gaya hai. To farmaaeyga: Main ne use duniya mein tum par dhaanpa tha aur main use aaj tumharey liye maaf karta hun. To use uski nekiyon ka naama diya jaaeyga. Aur kaafir aur munaafiq to gawaah kahengey: (Ye wo hain jinhon-ne apne Rab par jhoot baandha. Khabardaar! Zaalimon par Allah ki laanat hai). (Bukhari: 2441)"
"1115","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman Musalman ka bhai hai. Na us par zulm karta hai aur na usey (dushman key supurd) karta hai. Aur jo apne bhai ki haajat mein hoga to Allah uski haajat mein hoga. Aur jo Musalman se takleef door karey to Allah us se Qiyaamat key din ki takleefon mein se takleef door karega. Aur jo Musalman ko dhaanpey to Allah use Qiyaamat key din dhaanpega. (Bukhari: 2442)"
"1116","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne bhai ki madad karo, zaalim ho ya mazloom. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham uski madad kartey hain jab wo mazloom ho. To ham uski madad kaisey karein jab wo zaalim ho? Aap ne farmaya: Uskey haathon key upar pakdo. (Bukhari: 2444)"
"1117","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Zulm Qiyaamat key din andherey hain. (Bukhari: 2447)"
"1118","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jiski apne bhai key liye uski izzat ya kisi cheez mein naainsaafi ho to use aaj us se muaf karaa lena chaahiye, us se pehley ke deenaar aur dirham na hon. Agar uskey paas nek amal hoga to us se uski naainsaafi key qadr liya jaaeyga. Aur agar uskey paas nekiyaan na hongi to uskey saathi key gunaahon mein se liya jaaeyga aur us par daal diya jaaeyga. (Bukhari: 2449)"
"1119","[AI-translation] Saeed bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo zameen mein se kuchh zulm se ley to use saat zameenon ka haar pehnaaya jaaeyga. (Bukhari: 2452)"
"1120","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo zameen mein se kuchh naahaq ley to use Qiyaamat key din saat zameenon tak dhansa diya jaaeyga. (Bukhari: 2454)"
"1121","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se) riwayat hai ke wo qaum key paas se guzrey jo khajoor kha rahey they. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do (khajoorein) mila kar khaaney se mana kya hai magar ye ke tum mein se aadmi apne bhai se ijazat ley. (Bukhari: 2455)"
"1122","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah key paas aadmiyon mein sab se naapasandeeda sakht jhagda karney wala hai. (Bukhari: 2457)"
"1123","[AI-translation] Umm Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne apne hujrey key darwaazey par jhagda suna. To Aap unki taraf nikley aur farmaya: Beshak main bashar hun. Aur beshak merey paas muqadma aaney wala aata hai. To shayed tum mein se baaz baaz se zyada baat karney wala ho. To main gumaan karta hun ke wo sacha hai aur uskey liye uska faisla kar deta hun. Phir jiskey liye main ne Musalman key haq ka faisla kya to wo aag ka tukda hai. To use ley ya chhorey. (Bukhari: 2458)"
"1124","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha: Beshak tum hamein bhejey ho aur ham qaum key paas utartey hain jo hamaari mehmaan nawaazi nahi kartey. To uskey baarey mein tumhaara kya khayaal hai? To Aap ne ham se farmaya: Agar tum qaum key paas utro aur tumharey liye wo karaar diya jaey jo mehmaan key liye munaasib hai to qabool karo. Phir agar wo na karein to un se mehmaan ka haq lo. (Bukhari: 2461)"
"1125","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Padosi padosi ko apni lakdi uski deewar mein gaadney se na rokey. Phir Abu Hurairah kehtey hain: Mujhey kya hai ke main tumhey us se munh modtey huey dekhta hun. Allah ki qasam! Main zaroor use tumharey kandhon key darmiyaan phenkunga. (Bukhari: 2463). Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Abu Talha key ghar mein qaum ko pilaata tha. Aur unki sharaab us din Fazeekh thi. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pukaarne waley ko hukm diya jo pukaarey: Khabardaar! Beshak sharaab haraam kar di gai hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To Abu Talha ne mujh se kaha: Niklo aur use baha do. To main nikla aur use baha diya. To wo Madina ki galiyon mein behnein lagi. To qaum mein se baaz ne kaha: Qaum qatl ki gai jabke wo unkey peton mein thi. To Allah ne naazil farmaya: (Jo imaan laaey aur nek amal kiye un par us mein gunaah nahi jo unhon-ne khaaya) aayat. (2464). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1126","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Raaston par baithney se bacho. To unhon-ne kaha: Hamaari majboori hai, wo hamaari majlisein hain jin mein ham baat kartey hain. Aap ne farmaya: Phir agar tum majlison key siwa inkaar kartey ho to raastey ko uska haq do. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur raastey ka haq kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Nigaah neechi rakhna aur takleef rokna aur salaam ka jawaab dena aur neki ka hukm aur buraai se rokna. (Bukhari: 2465)"
"1127","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne faisla kya ke jab wo raastey mein jhagdein to saat haath (chhoda jaey). (Bukhari: 2473)"
"1128","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Yazeed Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne lootmaar aur (laash ka) musla karney se mana kya hai. (Bukhari: 2474)"
"1129","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo apne maal ki (hifaazat mein) qatl kya gaya wo shaheed hai. (Bukhari: 2480)"
"1130","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni baaz biwiyon key paas they. To Ummahaat-ul-Momineen mein se aik ne khaadim key sath pyaala bheja jis mein khaana tha. To us ne apne haath se maara aur pyaala tod diya. To Aap ne use joda aur us mein khaana rakkha aur farmaya: Khaao. Aur bhejaney waley aur pyaaley ko rok liya yahan tak ke wo faarigh huey. To durust pyaala dey diya aur tootey huey ko rok liya. (Bukhari: 2481). Shirkat ki kitaab."
